  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In a Legends of Ren Zu excerpt, Ren Zu, Great Strength True Martial, and Carefree Wisdom Heart dig for true meaning in a vast sea of knowledge. Only Carefree Wisdom Heart stays calm and composed with a serious and solemn expression. Great Strength True Martial points out that another Gu has grown on her body. The newly born Gu is called serious Gu. She is happy and says that with this Gu she will be able to recognize true meaning more easily. Learning Gu and talent Gu appear on her afterward in the same stretch.",
        "chapters": [
          2177
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
          "char_ren_zu",
          "char_great_strength_true_martial",
          "char_carefree_wisdom_heart",
          "gu_learning_gu",
          "gu_talent_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Star Constellation Immortal Venerable revives and moves for Primordial Domain, Fairy Feng Ya’s talent Gu and Fairy Yu Xiu’s serious Gu and learning Gu, which were temporarily taken out from Divine Emperor City, activate one after another inside her immortal aperture while immortal essence is consumed intensely.",
        "chapters": [
          2184
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "divine-emperor-city-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
          "loc_primordial_domain",
          "char_fairy_feng_ya",
          "char_fairy_yu_xiu",
          "house_divine_emperor_city"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In a later Legends of Ren Zu stretch, Carefree Wisdom Heart supports Practice Gu’s plan for Great Strength True Martial to undergo situations and recognize himself. She gives serious Gu to Great Strength True Martial before he and Practice Gu begin that work inside floating ice.",
        "chapters": [
          2294
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "gift-to-true-martial",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_practice_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
